@try-works/dsh-paper-design README · Install：Add this package to the profile and its `bundles` list, e.g. in `~/.dsh/profiles/<name>/package.json`:

```json
{
  "dependencies": {
    "@try-works/dsh-paper-design": "^0.1.6"
  },

Then `pnpm install` in the profile and restart the running DSH process. The bridge ships its `src/*.ts` sources directly (DSH loads them through `tsx`), mirroring `dsh-recursive-mode`.

> Restart is required for host/bundle changes: the web client-plugin HMR only rebuilds the web shell, not host plugins.

@try-works/dsh-paper-design README · Usage：- Ask the agent to read or design in Paper; it will use `paper_get_basic_info`, `paper_open_file`, `paper_get_screenshot`, and the rest.
- `/paper-reconnect` republishes the tools and re-syncs after restarting Paper Desktop. You normally do not need it: the tools appear on their own when Paper starts.
- `/paper-auth-status` / `/paper-auth-login` / `/paper-auth-logout` manage OAuth auth when a server requires it.
